    "notes": "Return from the system Files Download root to Files home and then to the prior NextN Downloads root using two manifest-owned Back actions. Receive the final NextN layout. Acceptance requires the four retained tasks, no Gallery 675023/True Blue task, NextN foreground, and AWAKE with the long timeout."
